<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>插件在 SpringBoard 内运行，按信号强度在不同 WiFi（不同 SSID）之间切换；同一个 WiFi 名下的多个路由器之间怎么漫游，仍由 iOS 自己处理。所有开关改完立即生效，不需要注销。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>基本设置</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>总开关。关闭后引擎完全不扫描、不切换，只剩本设置面板和日志可用。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>enabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用插件</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>锁屏期间暂停扫描以省电，解锁后 5 秒内自动补扫一次。想让锁屏时也一直保持最强信号，就把它关掉（会更耗电）。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>skipWhenLocked</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>锁屏时不扫描</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>每一针的判定过程都写进日志（为什么跳过、候选网络得分多少）。排障时打开，平时关掉，避免日志一直变大。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>debugLog</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>输出详细日志</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>逻辑很简单：当前 WiFi 信号跌破自己频段的「触发阈值」才去扫描（平时完全不扫，不耗电）；扫到的高于「切换目标阈值」的网络全部参与比较，符合条件的 5G 优先、2.4G 次之，按分数选最强的立刻切。dBm 是负数，越接近 0 越强（-50 很强，-85 很弱）。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>扫描与阈值</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>10</integer>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>防抖用：两次扫描之间最少隔这么久，自定义，最小 5 秒，默认 10 秒。它不是扫描节奏——信号好时根本不会扫，只有跌破触发阈值才扫，这里只是防止信号在阈值边缘抖动时连环扫描。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>scanInterval</string>
			<key>keyboard</key>
			<string>NumbersAndPunctuation</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>最短扫描间隔（秒）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>-75</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>核心开关：当前连接的是 2.4G WiFi，跌破这个值才扫描，默认 -75（约 2 格）。高于它完全不扫描、不耗电。5G 用下面单独的「5G 触发阈值」。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>forceThreshold</string>
			<key>keyboard</key>
			<string>NumbersAndPunctuation</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>扫描触发阈值（dBm）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>-72</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>当前连接的是 5G WiFi 时用这个阈值，默认 -72（5G 衰减快，更早触发切走）。5G 信号读数抖得凶，会等连续两针（约 10 秒）都低于它才真扫，防误扫。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>triggerThreshold5G</string>
			<key>keyboard</key>
			<string>NumbersAndPunctuation</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>5G 触发阈值（dBm）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>-70</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>扫描后只把信号高于这个值的网络当候选，默认 -70（约 2~3 格）。比它弱的即使比当前强也不切——避免从一个弱网跳到另一个弱网。必须高于触发阈值。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>intervalThreshold</string>
			<key>keyboard</key>
			<string>NumbersAndPunctuation</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>切换目标阈值（dBm）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>3</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>防抖用：候选还要比当前好这么多"分"才切（-100dBm=0 分、-50dBm=100 分）。默认 3 分，只为避免两个几乎一样强的网络来回跳；填 0 = 只要高于目标阈值且更强就切。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>minDelta</string>
			<key>keyboard</key>
			<string>NumbersAndPunctuation</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>最小切换差值（%）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>5GHz 速度快、干扰少但穿墙差。这里的做法是给 5GHz 网络额外加权，让它和 2.4GHz 差不多强时优先选 5GHz。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>5GHz 偏好</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>打开后 5GHz 网络在比较时额外加分（加分值 = 下面「容忍差值」的一半）。关掉就是纯按信号强度选。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>prefer5G</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>优先 5GHz</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>15</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>填 15 表示 5GHz 多算 7.5 分，相当于允许 5GHz 比 2.4GHz 弱一点仍被优先选中。想更偏袒 5GHz 就调大到 20~30，想以信号为准就调小到 0。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>prefer5GMaxDiff</string>
			<key>keyboard</key>
			<string>NumbersAndPunctuation</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>5GHz 容忍差值（%）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>这两项解决"能切给谁"和"切不动怎么办"。默认只在你已经连着 WiFi 时做切换，不会主动从没网变有网。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>切换范围与失败处理</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSLinkCell</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>点进去可加任意多个 SSID：从扫描到的网络里点选，或手动输入。留空 = 扫描到的任何网络都可参与比较（没保存过密码的会被尝试、失败后进冷却）；填了就只切到名单里的网络。建议只填自己保存过密码的。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>whitelist</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>白名单 SSID（可加多个）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>⚠️ 因未连接状态下扫描会让 SpringBoard 崩进安全模式，本开关自 v5.3.1 起暂时无效：插件在未连接 WiFi 时一律不扫描（手动扫描也会被拦住）。已连接的 WiFi 信号弱时自动切换不受影响。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>autoJoinWhenDisconnected</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>未连接时自动连最强</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>300</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.liush.wifistrongest</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>某个网络关联失败后，这段时间内不再尝试它。默认 300 秒（5 分钟），最小 30。失败的常见原因：没保存过密码、需要网页认证、密码被改、信号扫描时够但连接时掉、DHCP 或认证超时。设太短会反复重试导致耗电和系统弹"无法加入网络"。</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>failCooldown</string>
			<key>keyboard</key>
			<string>NumbersAndPunctuation</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>失败冷却（秒）</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>WiFi 择优切换</string>
</dict>
</plist>
